  <h2 id="kya-hai">Email Marketing Kya Hai?</h2>
  <p>Email marketing ek aisa tarika hai jisme business apne customers ya audience ko seedha unke email inbox mein messages bhejta hai — naye product ki jaankari, offers, ya useful content. Fark sirf itna hai ki ye Instagram ya Facebook ki tarah algorithm par depend nahi karta — jo list aapne banayi hai, wo sirf aapki hai, koi platform use band nahi kar sakta.</p>

  <h2 id="kyun">Email Marketing Kyun Zaroori Hai?</h2>
  <p>Bahut log sochte hain ki email marketing purana ho chuka hai, lekin data kuch aur kehta hai:</p>
  <table>
    <tr><th>Channel</th><th>Average ROI</th></tr>
    <tr><td>Email Marketing</td><td>₹3600+ per ₹100 spend (industry average)</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Social Media Ads</td><td>Comparatively kam, aur cost badhti rehti hai</td></tr>
  </table>
  <p>Iska reason simple hai — jo insaan aapko apna email deta hai, wo already interested hota hai. Isliye conversion rate social media se kaafi zyada hoti hai.</p>

  <h2 id="list">Email List Kaise Banayein?</h2>
  <p>List banane ke liye sabse pehla step hai ek <strong>lead magnet</strong> — yaani kuch free cheez jo aap logon ko unke email ke badle dete hain:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Free PDF guide ya checklist</li>
    <li>Discount coupon (agar aap product bechte hain)</li>
    <li>Free mini-course ya template</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Ye lead magnet apne blog, Instagram bio link, ya YouTube description mein daal dein — jo bhi log dilchaspi dikhayenge, wo apna email de denge.</p>

  <div class="callout">
    <strong>Tip:</strong> Kabhi bhi list khareedein nahi. Khareedi hui list spam complaints badhati hai aur aapka sender reputation kharab ho jaata hai.
  </div>

  <h2 id="tools">Best Free Email Marketing Tools</h2>
  <p>Beginners ke liye ye tools free plan ke saath shuru kiye ja sakte hain:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Mailchimp</strong> – 500 subscribers tak free, beginner-friendly interface</li>
    <li><strong>Brevo (Sendinblue)</strong> – Monthly email limit zyada deta hai free plan mein</li>
    <li><strong>MailerLite</strong> – Simple automation ke liye accha option</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="campaign">Pehla Campaign Kaise Bhejein?</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Tool mein account banayein aur apna sender name/email verify karein</li>
    <li>Ek simple, clear subject line likhein — clickbait avoid karein</li>
    <li>Email body mein ek hi clear message aur ek CTA (call-to-action) rakhein</li>
    <li>Mobile par preview check karein — zyadatar log phone par email padhte hain</li>
    <li>Choti si test list ko bhejein, phir pure list ko schedule karein</li>
  </ol>

  <h2 id="tips">Open Rate Badhane Ke Tips</h2>
  <p>Email bhejna kaafi nahi hai — log use khole bhi, iske liye ye cheezein dhyan mein rakhein:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Subject line short aur curiosity-driven rakhein, bina misleading hue</li>
    <li>Sending time test karein — subah 9-11 baje aksar accha response deta hai</li>
    <li>Personalization use karein — jaise "Hi [Naam]" se start karna</li>
    <li>Consistency rakhein — weekly ya bi-weekly schedule follow karein</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="galtiyan">Beginners Ki Common Galtiyan</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Pehle din se hi roz-roz email bhejna — subscribers unsubscribe kar dete hain</li>
    <li>Sirf selling emails bhejna, value-based content na dena</li>
    <li>Unsubscribe link na rakhna — ye legally bhi zaroori hota hai</li>
    <li>Mobile-friendly design ignore karna</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Conclusion</h2>
  <p>Email marketing ek slow lekin sabse reliable tarika hai apni audience ke saath direct connection banane ka. Shuruaat choti list se karein, consistently value dein, aur dhire-dhire ye aapke business ya blog ke liye sabse trusted marketing channel ban jaayega.</p>

